    {
      "title": "Exercise 1: Manual Wrap Short Rows",
      "slug": "exercise-1-manual-wrap-short-rows",
      "displayOrder": 2,
      "legacy": {
        "itemId": 831,
        "lessonOrder": 2
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "components": [
            {
              "type": "richText",
              "html": "<Style>\r\n.lightlist ul { padding-left:20px; list-style:none; }\r\n.lightlist li { margin-bottom:10px; }\r\n.lightlist li:before {'FontAwesome';\r\ncontent: '\\f00c';\r\nmargin:0 5px 0 -15px;\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n\r\n\r\n<b>NOTE:</b>\r\nThe goal of the manual wrap:<br>\r\n<ul class=\"lightlist\" style=\"list-style:none;\">\r\n<li>Put the instructed number of needles in hold OPPOSITE the carriage</li>\r\n<li>Knit across and WRAP</li>\r\n<li>Knit back</li>\r\n<li>Repeat this as instructed</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n\r\n<img src=\"/challenge/images/v2/123/manual_wrap.jpg\">\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n\r\n<div>\r\n\r\n<ol>\r\n<li>Cast on 20 (40) stitches</li>\r\n<li> Knit 10 (20) rows</li>\r\n<li><b>End with the carriage on the LEFT</b></li>\r\n<li> Set carriage to Hold </li>\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n<li><i class=\"fa-solid fa-asterisk\"></i> Opposite the carriage, put  5 (8) needles in <a data-GlossaryId='185' class='glossaryhelp'>Holding position <i class='fa fa-question-circle-o' aria-hidden='true'></i></a></i>\r\n<li>Knit LEFT to RIGHT</li>\r\n<li>Wrap the last needle (to prevent a hole)</li>\r\n<lI>Knit back (right to left) <i class=\"fa-solid fa-asterisk\"></i></li>\r\n\r\n<hr class=\"style13\">\r\n<li>Repeat from <i class=\"fa-solid fa-asterisk\"></i> to  <i class=\"fa-solid fa-asterisk\"></i> until all needles are in hold</li>\r\n<li>Tip: Cancel hold and knit 1 row across all needles \r\n<div style=\"padding-left: 10px;\"><em>  This row makes it easier to rehang the stitches from scrap and can be removed before binding off the shoulders if desired</em>\r\n\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Scrap off</li>\r\n\r\n</ol>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n <div class=\"videopopup\" data-videotitle=\"short row refresher\" data-vimeoid=\"251895484\">\r\n\t\t<img class=\"img-thumbnail\" src=\"https://i.vimeocdn.com/video/678388736-7309600a83dd8fd82b8e1db2523f64b6c0b827ca8d3e9626b1d5383f83cdea3b-d_1280x720?r=pad\">\r\n\t\t<div class=\"imagecenter text-center\"><button class=\"btn btn-sm\"><i class=\"fa fa-youtube-play fa-2x learn\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></i></button></div>\t\t\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n\r\n",
              "legacyComponentId": 9737,
              "order": 1
            }
          ],
          "title": "Manual Wrap Practice",
          "slug": "manual-wrap-practice",
